 developed by Nestlé, specifically designed for patients who require high-energy and high-protein diets. It is available in a variety of flavors, catering to different taste preferences while providing essential dietary support.", "RESOURCE SUPPORT INSTANT:A nutritional supplement by Nestlé, available in powder form, designed for patients needing dietary support.", "PROSURE:PROSURE is a nutritional drink developed by Abbott, specifically formulated to meet the dietary needs of patients requiring additional nutritional support. This supplement provides essential nutrients and is available in multiple flavors and presentations, catering to the diverse preferences of its users.", "SUPPORTAN DRINK:Supportan Drink is a nutritional beverage produced by Fresenius Kabi, specifically designed to provide energy and protein for patients in need of nutritional support. This product is available in a variety of flavors, catering to different taste preferences while fulfilling its purpose of aiding in the nutritional needs of individuals.", "FORTICARE:FORTICARE is a nutritional product developed by Nutricia, specifically designed to meet the dietary needs of patients requiring increased nutritional support. It provides a high-calorie and protein-rich formulation, making it suitable for individuals with heightened energy requirements. Available in various flavors, FORTICARE aims to deliver essential nutrients effectively, ensuring that patients receive the dietary assistance they need for optimal health and recovery.", "PLANTAGO OVATA:Plantago ovata is a natural fiber supplement used as a bulk-forming laxative, commonly recommended for chronic constipation.", "BISACODILO:Bisacodilo is a stimulant laxative used to treat constipation by stimulating bowel movements.", "ONDANSETRÓN:Ondansetron, also known as Ondansetrón, is an antiemetic medication that serves to prevent nausea and vomiting, particularly those induced by cancer treatments. It functions as a 5HT3 antagonist, effectively reducing the incidence of nausea and vomiting associated with such therapies.", "ACICLOVIR:Aciclovir is an antiviral medication primarily used to treat infections caused by specific types of viruses, including herpes. It is recommended that Aciclovir be taken with meals to minimize gastrointestinal discomfort. Additionally, it is effective in addressing viral infections that may lead to symptoms such as nausea and aversion to food.", "MACROGOL:", "BROWN JK:Brown JK is an author of a guide by the American Cancer Society regarding nutrition and physical activity during and after cancer treatment.", "QUIMIO:QUIMIO refers to chemotherapy, a type of cancer treatment that utilizes drugs to target and kill cancer cells. This treatment method is known to present nutritional challenges for patients undergoing therapy, as the side effects of the drugs can impact their ability to maintain a healthy diet.", "SOPORTE NUTRICIONAL:SOPORTE NUTRICIONAL, or nutritional support, is a vital intervention aimed at enhancing the tolerance to treatment and improving the quality of life for patients suffering from malnutrition. It is particularly crucial for individuals who have undergone metabolic surgery, especially those experiencing complications. Nutritional support plays a significant role in the management of various health conditions, including cancer and dementia, as it helps to improve overall health outcomes.\n\nThis support is designed to meet the dietary needs of patients who are unable to eat normally, including those with intestinal failure and critically ill patients. It encompasses a range of methods and practices to provide nutrition, especially for patients who cannot consume food orally. Nutritional support is also essential in clinical settings for individuals with eating disorders and is particularly important for children who require assistance in meeting their dietary needs.\n\nOverall, SOPORTE NUTRICIONAL is a comprehensive approach to ensuring that patients receive the necessary dietary assistance to enhance their clinical outcomes and overall well-being.", "PACIENTES QUEMADOS:\"PACIENTES QUEMADOS\" refers to individuals who have suffered from burns and require specialized nutritional management due to their hypermetabolic and catabolic responses following the injury. These patients are particularly vulnerable, as they often experience critical burn injuries that place them at a high risk of malnutrition. Their condition is characterized by hypermetabolism, hypercatabolism, and inflammation, necessitating careful dietary interventions to support their recovery and overall health."], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperature": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": null, "presence_penalty": null, "top_p": 1.0, "max_tokens": 4000, "n": 1}, "history": null}